        "# Section C: The Prediction Challenge - Yield Curve Construction\n",
        "\n",
        "## Overview\n",
        "Using calibrated CIR parameters and the 3M rate as proxy for instantaneous short rate r_t,\n",
        "we reconstruct the entire yield curve (6M through 30Y) for each day in the test period.\n",
        "\n",
        "**Core Requirement:**\n",
        "- Input: Only the 3M yield for each test day\n",
        "- Output: Predicted yields for 6M, 9M, 1Y, 2Y, 5Y, 10Y, 20Y, 30Y\n",
        "- Compare: Against held-out actual test yields\n",
        "\n",
        "**CIR Yield Formula:**\n",
        "$$y(t, T) = -\\frac{1}{T-t}\\ln P(t, T)$$\n",
        "where P(t, T) is computed using calibrated (κ, θ, σ) and observed r_t."
      ]
