        "### Extension Performance: Meaningful Improvement vs. Overfitting\n",
        "\n",
        "**Meaningful Out-of-Sample Improvement:**\n",
        "The implementation of the **Jump-Diffusion Process** provided a highly meaningful improvement to out-of-sample performance. By adding a Poisson jump component to handle structural market shocks, the extension successfully reduced the simulation RMSE from 0.0210 to 0.0180 and slashed the Mean Absolute Percentage Error (MAPE) by over 11% (dropping from 74.9% to 63.7%) on unseen test data.\n",
        "\n",
